<title>GERMANY: MOTORCYCLING-GRID FOR GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-GRID FOR GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>NUERBURGRING, Germany 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starting grid for</p>
<p>Sunday's German 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix after Saturday's</p>
<p>final qualifying practice (track length 4.550 km):</p>
<p> 1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda	 one minute 38.425</p>
<p>seconds (average speed 166.421 km/h)</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda		 1:38.757</p>
<p> 3. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda	     1:39.069</p>
<p> 4. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha	     1:39.187</p>
<p> 5. Jean-Michel Bayle (France) Modenas     1:39.266</p>
<p> 6. Takuma Aoki (Japan) Honda		  1:39.412</p>
<p> 7. Doriano Romboni (Italy)  Aprilia	 1:39.500</p>
<p> 8. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda		 1:39.714</p>
